<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_8_-_1_6_-_0_0_3_0_-_e_x_p_o_s_e_-_l_o_a_d_e_r_-_c_o_n_t_e_n_t_-_i_d_e_n_t_i_t_i_e_s_-_a_n_d_-_p_r_e_p_a_r_e_-_0_-_2_-_2.behavior_patch.package-distribution apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "package-distribution" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://package-distribution/requirements/immutable-0-2-2-candidate" } (
      <Requirement #immutable-0-2-2-candidate (
        <Statement ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHS>
        系统 SHALL 把 additive layered registry、loader content identities、effective identity projector 与 typed dependency snapshot 准备为新的 halfcode-compiler.xnl@0.2.2 candidate，并保持已发布 0.2.1 与既有 public specifiers 不变。
        </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHS>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #patch-candidate { name = "0.2.2 release candidate" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #packed-runtime-types (
                <Given ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHT>
                consumer 只安装本地 0.2.2 tarball
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHT>
                <When ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHV>
                导入全部十个 public specifiers，并从 resource-core 执行真实 loader、layers、identity projector 与 snapshot
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHV>
                <Then ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHW>
                runtime 与 TypeScript consumer SHALL 通过且制品不得引用 private workspace packages
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHW>
              )>
              <Case #preserve-public-compatibility (
                <Given ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHX>
                0.2.1 consumer 使用旧 root/subpath API 和 structural ResourceTree
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHX>
                <When ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHY>
                切换到 0.2.2 candidate
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHY>
                <Then ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHZ>
                旧行为 SHALL 保持，新增 API 仅为 additive
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEHZ>
              )>
              <Case #prepare-without-publication (
                <Given ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEJ0>
                尚未取得外部 registry 发布授权
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEJ0>
                <When ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEJ1>
                本 track 完成 candidate build、pack 与校验
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEJ1>
                <Then ?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEJ2>
                系统 SHALL 记录 candidate evidence 但不得执行 npm publish 或替换任何已发布版本
                </?01M0TB1VG00C2D74XB5ZN9SEJ2>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
